---
import ConverterPage from '../components/ConverterPage.astro';
---

<ConverterPage
  path="/tamil-font-converter"
  lede="Planned: a Tamil font converter for Bamini and other legacy Tamil fonts to Unicode Tamil."
>
  <h2>Planned, not started</h2>
  <p>
    Bamini is the Tamil equivalent of Kruti Dev: the legacy font that a great
    deal of older Tamil typing was done in, still sitting inside documents that
    now need to go into Unicode systems.
  </p>
  <p>
    Tamil script works differently from Devanagari. It has its own vowel-sign
    behaviour and its own rules about which signs move where, so this needs its
    own engine work rather than a new lookup table. The route is scaffolded; it
    will be built only after a keyword check and a mapping tested against real
    Tamil documents.
  </p>
</ConverterPage>
